## What is PySpark?

The certification exam expects you to have a reasonable understanding of PySpark

- PySpark is the Python API for Apache Spark
- It offers greater flexibility than Spark SQL
- We can easily integrates with Python Libraries

SparkSQL is great for Queries but PySpark is perfect when you need programmable control over you data workflows

## DataFrames

Data Frames are stores in memory across many machines for parallel processing

